# Template for the environment variables.
# Copy it as .env and write the values only on your own computer.
# .env is excluded from git (see .gitignore), so the values do not end up in the repository by mistake.
# This file, instead, is in the repository: never write a real value in it, only the names.
#
# Phase 0: no variables.
# Variables are added when they are needed, from Phase 1.
# The key that deploys the contract will not go in the .env file: it will go in an encrypted
# store (keystore), kept outside the repository folder.
